AgentMax evals layer
====================

The design of this evaluation harness (the scorer / case / report contract) and
the normalized-match logic in scorers.py are adapted from the OpenJarvis
project:

    OpenJarvis — https://github.com/open-jarvis/OpenJarvis
    Copyright the OpenJarvis authors.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is available at:

    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

This is a deliberately reduced port: only the self-contained core was taken
(case/scorer/report types, generic scorers, a runner, JSONL dataset loading).
OpenJarvis's inference backends, HuggingFace dataset providers, benchmark-
specific scorers (SWE-bench, GAIA, MMLU, …), agentic runner, trackers, and CLI
were intentionally not ported.
